        <item>
            <title>1.0.6</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:10:05 +1300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Plug in a different iPhone or iPad and it opens straight away.</li>
<li>More than one device connected? Switch between them in the sidebar or the Go menu. Each one returns to the folder you left.</li>
<li>iPads are now called iPads throughout.</li>
<li>Copies are tied to their device, so a paused one only resumes on the right one.</li>
<li>Free space now matches Finder.</li>
<li>Shift-click selects a range in the grid.</li>
<li>Quick Look says why a large file can't be previewed when you arrow to it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
