            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Resume picks up where it left off, including folders.</li>
<li>Copying lots of small files to and from apps is much faster.</li>
<li>Big folders open faster.</li>
<li>Replace keeps the old file until the new one has arrived, and a file never replaces a folder.</li>
<li>Cancel responds faster.</li>
<li>Clearer messages when a file changes during a copy.</li>
<li>Free space updates after copying and deleting.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
